#: ../../getting-started.md:1 a55707dc354c4625976fe20388e5d854
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "開始使用"

#: ../../getting-started.md:3 4f279417b203471d8a249d698519bf7b
msgid "Run the backend and frontend"
msgstr "啟動後端與前端"

#: ../../getting-started.md:5 577cf472676b43a7af80bf24544a1c56
msgid "The workbench is a browser app talking to a pricing service. Both have to be running, and the service comes first."
msgstr "這套工作台是一個瀏覽器應用程式，與一個定價服務對談。兩者都要在執行中，而且服務要先啟動。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:17 63008098774045f4aecb7eb5ae8f427e
msgid "`npm install` generates `src/gen/` from the `proto/` submodule. Those bindings are deliberately not committed — one source of truth, no stale copies — so a fresh clone must run it before the app will build."
msgstr "`npm install` 會從 `proto/` 子模組產生 `src/gen/`。這些繫結刻意不納入版本控制——只留一份真相來源，不留過期副本——因此剛複製下來的專案必須先跑過它，應用程式才能建置。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:21 7e34172060a34020a4029191620af63a
msgid "`VITE_WS_URL` overrides the service address if it is not on `ws://127.0.0.1:9111`; `.env.example` carries the default."
msgstr "若服務不在 `ws://127.0.0.1:9111`，以 `VITE_WS_URL` 覆寫位址；預設值放在 `.env.example`。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:24 d01351c7472441ad989cba9d8d44ea03
msgid "Prove the chain works"
msgstr "驗證整條鏈路是通的"

#: ../../getting-started.md:26 5bbd1beb73774a58a473999d44de5417
msgid "Press **run reference check** at the top of the centre column. It opens a session on the market from `HANDLERS.md`, prices the option that document prices, and shows the answer:"
msgstr "按下中間欄上方的 **run reference check**。它會以 `HANDLERS.md` 的市場開一個工作階段，為那份文件所計價的選擇權定價，並顯示答案："

#: ../../getting-started.md:30 9ebe207c8e4c4dc996f29e90f031852e
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\text{NPV} = 12.459717"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting-started.md:32 bf9aa4ad494f4bc18f5ccc1c9441a2d7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "If that number comes back, the whole chain is working — socket, schema, market construction, engine dispatch and the result mapping. If it does not, the problem is below the interface, and {doc}`troubleshooting` is the page for it."
msgstr "只要這個數字回來了，整條鏈路就是通的——連線、結構描述、市場建構、引擎派工，以及結果對應。若沒有回來，問題出在介面之下，該看的是 {doc}`troubleshooting`。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:36 c56d9ac1d2394ff0987cfe1752b81ff7
msgid "Two further things are worth doing in the first five minutes, because they are what the application is *for*:"
msgstr "前五分鐘還有兩件事值得做，因為它們正是這個應用程式存在的理由："

#: ../../getting-started.md:39 292c46c6bb6944498a7041f1d75f1b5f
msgid "**Drag a quote slider** in the bar along the bottom. The price follows and nothing is rebuilt — writes coalesce so only one round trip is ever in flight. This is the live graph doing its job."
msgstr "**拖動底部列的報價滑桿。**價格會跟著走，而且沒有任何東西被重建——寫入會合併，所以任何時刻只有一次往返在飛。這就是即時物件圖在做它的工作。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:42 8a0aef673fba434691393fcd6a6cce5b
msgid "**Stop the service and start it again.** The socket reconnects, the workbook replays into a new session, and the trade reprices — the client owns the market definition, which is what makes that possible. Cut the connection without stopping the service and you get the other path: the session is held for a minute, and the app takes it back with the same id and the same graph."
msgstr "**把服務停掉再啟動。**連線會重新接上，工作簿會重播成一個新的工作階段，交易重新計價——市場定義由用戶端擁有，這才使它成為可能。若不停掉服務而只是切斷連線，走的是另一條路：工作階段會被保留一分鐘，應用程式會以同一個代號、同一份物件圖把它接回來。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:49 b963a90c24d14e65ac043f12c5a11682
msgid "Keep this open beside it"
msgstr "把它開在旁邊"

#: ../../getting-started.md:51 b51613b9513f42278278b6accee40369
msgid "The **guide** button at the right-hand end of the status bar opens this document in a tab of its own — a tab of its own on purpose, because navigating away drops the socket, and a session only outlives that for a minute."
msgstr "狀態列最右端的 **guide** 按鈕會在獨立分頁開啟這份文件——刻意用獨立分頁，因為離開頁面就會斷線，而工作階段只能比連線多活一分鐘。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:55 f9ea9345022e4c17af00611200611d21
msgid "The guide's front page, opened from the workbench's status bar: the sidebar with both tables of contents, the search box, the English/Chinese switch, and the three-layer figure."
msgstr "從工作台狀態列開啟的說明書首頁：側邊欄有兩份目錄、搜尋框、中英文切換，以及三層架構圖。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:59 ddeeb89705c44032b4b9d17552eceb8f
msgid "What the button opens. It points at `doc/_build/html/index.html`, which is where `npm run docs` writes this guide and which the dev server serves from the project root; a deployment that serves it elsewhere sets `VITE_DOCS_URL`."
msgstr "按鈕開啟的內容。它指向 `doc/_build/html/index.html`，也就是 `npm run docs` 寫出這份說明書的位置，而開發伺服器會從專案根目錄提供它；若部署時放在別處，設定 `VITE_DOCS_URL`。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:64 723b00116ff24b4b99de5d140c542145
msgid "If the button gives you a 404, the guide has not been built yet — `npm run docs` is the whole of the fix."
msgstr "如果按鈕給你 404，代表說明書還沒建置——`npm run docs` 就是全部的修法。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:67 fd38b84b2b6c4eaf9f23be3bcc55c55c
msgid "The door"
msgstr "門"

#: ../../getting-started.md:69 74f8d211d78845b0a026a45e408c2b5a
msgid "The service checks the browser's `Origin` on the WebSocket upgrade. This is not belt-and-braces: a WebSocket upgrade is **not** subject to the same-origin policy, so binding the service to loopback is no protection against a page — any tab could otherwise open `ws://127.0.0.1:9111` and spend the machine's CPU on it."
msgstr "服務會在 WebSocket 升級時檢查瀏覽器送來的 `Origin`。這不是多此一舉：WebSocket 升級**不**受同源政策約束，所以把服務綁在本機回送位址並不能擋住網頁——否則任何一個分頁都能開啟 `ws://127.0.0.1:9111` 並吃光這台機器的 CPU。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:75 c5e51da3e94c46628c2e15aefddd0537
msgid "The defaults already include the Vite dev and preview origins (`localhost` and `127.0.0.1` on ports 5173 and 4173). Serve this app from anywhere else and start the service with `--allow-origin <that origin>`, or the socket is refused with `403` before the app can say anything about it. A client that sends no `Origin` header at all — a script, a proxy that already checked — is unaffected, which is why the command-line tools keep working."
msgstr "預設清單已包含 Vite 的開發與預覽來源（`localhost` 與 `127.0.0.1` 的 5173 與 4173 埠）。若從其他位址提供本應用程式，請以 `--allow-origin <該來源>` 啟動服務，否則連線會在應用程式來得及說任何話之前就被 `403` 拒絕。完全不送 `Origin` 標頭的用戶端——腳本，或已經檢查過的代理伺服器——不受影響，這也是命令列工具照常運作的原因。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:82 3e4db914e7414879add10afca2183176
msgid "The vocabulary"
msgstr "詞彙"

#: ../../getting-started.md:84 260a3dc9326b411fb53beff4c3bd55c0
msgid "Four words are used precisely throughout this guide and throughout the interface."
msgstr "本說明書與介面自始至終都精確地使用這四個詞。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:87 6f15267fc93f44de897ceb5a108fe4e8
msgid "Session"
msgstr "工作階段（session）"

#: ../../getting-started.md:88 f1752bcfcf6b4d659e720d37890dfa52
msgid "One live QuantLib object graph on the service, holding a worker seat. It is opened with a market, it survives between requests, and it outlives its socket by a grace window — a minute by default — so a client that drops can take it back rather than rebuild it. Each browser tab holds its own."
msgstr "服務上的一份 QuantLib 即時物件圖，佔用一個工作者席位。它以一個市場開啟，在多次請求之間存續，並比它的連線多活一段寬限期——預設一分鐘——因此斷線的用戶端可以把它接回來，而不必重建。每個瀏覽器分頁各持有自己的一份。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:93 345eca7b380640c1a1f903ec2b76c1f8
msgid "Workbook"
msgstr "工作簿（workbook）"

#: ../../getting-started.md:94 d1b0816a907449ef95704e3f9f74473c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The document *this app* owns: the market definition, the trade, and the panel state. It survives a refresh, exports as canonical Protobuf JSON, and is what gets replayed into a new session when a dropped one cannot be taken back. {doc}`interface` sets out the whole split of what is kept where."
msgstr "*本應用程式*擁有的文件：市場定義、交易，以及面板狀態。它能撐過重新整理，可匯出為標準的 Protobuf JSON，並在斷掉的工作階段接不回來時，被重播成一個新的工作階段。{doc}`interface` 完整說明了什麼東西存放在哪一邊。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:99 45d6be2f886b4ff69b073f752812a1fb
msgid "Structural edit"
msgstr "結構性編輯"

#: ../../getting-started.md:100 25963c8791e64770907fe1b2cf8f4353
msgid "A change to the shape of the graph — a curve, an index, the evaluation date. It cannot be written into a running session, so it needs a rebuild."
msgstr "改變物件圖形狀的變更——曲線、利率指標、評價日。它無法寫進執行中的工作階段，因此需要重建。"

#: ../../getting-started.md:103 8c5f104d521f444aa06ad68d3f5f3e1c
msgid "Live edit"
msgstr "即時編輯"

#: ../../getting-started.md:104 84a33f0315ec4120a972973d792e93db
msgid "A quote write. The only edit the service can carry into a graph that is already built, and therefore the only free one."
msgstr "報價寫入。這是服務唯一能帶進已建好物件圖的編輯，因此也是唯一免費的一種。"

#~ msgid "Run the two halves"
#~ msgstr "啟動兩個半邊"

